findings.comment:
Observed the following areas in need of more frequent cleaning to prevent an accumulation of soil residues:
(i) the ventilation hood;
(ii) the walls behind the stove and small fryers;
(iii) the grate of the air conditioner near the ventilation hood;
(iv) the wall behind the mop sink; 
(v) the underside of the soda machine near the soda water nozzle;
(vi) the seam of the handwashing sink.
PIC was notified of these areas and plans to clean these areas at the next deep clean of the facility. Ensure that nonfood-contact surfaces of equipment and surfaces are cleaned at a frequency necessary to prevent an accumulation of soil residues.
